8500 Granted by Cesar on 2026-10-14 through the owner's dashboard (question direct-budget-q1, issue #101).
Cause: a browser/direct/ page is four builds in one case (browser-direct and browser-tea, dev and
release), and Http.expectJson reaches the core/Schema library interpreter, which the release
specialiser processes in both release builds (issue #105).
Size: the highest count measured is 7 720M, on a baseline x86-64 build (-Dcpu=x86_64, SHA-256 in
software) with Node running the pages. The limit is that count plus 10% for growth of core/ and
the platforms. On this host's own CPU (Zen 2) the case is 4 799M, 5 710M with Node.
PR #104 counts every budget on one reference CPU, x86_64_v3+sha, where the case is 4 795M as on
Zen 2. After #104 lands, shrink this limit to 6 300M (5 710M plus 10%).
Remove when the case fits 4 300M without this file.
